& [P8GapMatrix] is the gap matrix opened by the imported boundary set
  + [gap] is P8-G01 fixture path policy and generated-output nonpromotion are not yet consolidated across P2, P3, P4, IR7, and IR8
  + [gap_status] is assigned_to_P8-S02
