  + [gap_status] is assigned_to_P8-S05
  + [gap] is P8-G05 downstream P5, P6, P8 implementation activation, and P9 gates need P8 completion review before consuming proof or fixture authority
  + [gap_status] is assigned_to_P8-S06

  = must: keep P8-G01 through P8-G05 as contiguous downstream slices
  = must: block P5 LangGraph runtime, P6 surface projection expansion, P8 fixture material creation, P7 dispatch-adjacent coordination expansion, and P9 live-control reconsideration until P8-S06 accepts the relevant gates

& [P8AuthorityClassMatrix: P8-S01] is the authority distinction matrix for P8
  + [record_kind] is fixture_oracle_plan
  + [authority_class] is planning_authority_for_future_fixture_obligations
  + [allowed_effect] is may define future fixture expectations and acceptance rules
  + [forbidden_effect] is cannot create fixture files, expected ledgers, generated outputs, or runtime effects
  + [record_kind] is fixture_source_file
  + [authority_class] is not_authorized_in_P8-S01
  + [allowed_effect] is none
  + [forbidden_effect] is file creation and test execution
  + [record_kind] is expected_ledger
  + [authority_class] is not_authorized_in_P8-S01
  + [allowed_effect] is none
  + [forbidden_effect] is ledger creation and proof acceptance
  + [record_kind] is generated_output
  + [authority_class] is generated_output_non_authority_when_future_authorized
  + [allowed_effect] is none in P8-S01
  + [forbidden_effect] is source authority, dispatch authority, operations authority, or live-control authority
  + [record_kind] is proof_pack
  + [authority_class] is accepted_proof_support
  + [allowed_effect] is may inform fixture obligation inventory and proof ledger planning
  + [forbidden_effect] is cannot become generalized fixture file policy without P8 review

  = must: use this matrix to reject authority promotion in P8-S02 through P8-S06
  = must: preserve unknown or mixed authority as SOP_first_interrupt or blocked review rather than fixture readiness

& [P8S01DownstreamGate] is the gate opened by P8-S01
  + [opened_slice] is P8-S02 fixture path policy and generated-output nonpromotion contract
  + [activation_basis] is P8-G01 assigned and accepted inputs imported
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is fixture path policy and generated-output nonpromotion affect all downstream proof and runtime authority
  + [completion_review_required] is true

  = must: open P8-S02 only after P8-S01 completion review accepts this boundary import
  = must: keep P8-S03 through P8-S06 gated until their predecessor reviews accept
